# website

## seo
- label: the Akron landing page and proxied documentation expose canonical crawler metadata, structured software identity, permissive robots directives, and one canonical-domain sitemap without changing rendered content
  command: bun test tests/seo.test.ts
  tags: [implemented]
- label: the Akron site publishes a successful llms.txt that identifies the project and links only to canonical Akron resources
  command: bun test tests/seo.test.ts
  tags: [implemented]

# operations

## status
- label: the Akron Website status monitor validates the current canonical page title so SEO metadata changes do not produce a false degraded state
  command: rg -Fq '[BODY] == pat(*<title>Akron - Celeste Mod Download and Olympus Install Guide</title>*)' ops/gatus/config.yaml
  tags: [implemented]
